    "why": "Frequency is domain-specific, so each Chinese arm is ranked against its own source rather than against a shared list. Measured top tens differ almost completely between the two domains, and ranking one arm against the other's domain produced an apparent contradiction in the rank analysis that was an artefact of a mismatched denominator.",
